#: src/tar.c:439
msgid ""
"GNU 'tar' saves many files together into a single tape or disk archive, and can restore individual files from the archive.\n"
"\n"
"Examples:\n"
"  tar -cf archive.tar foo bar  # Create archive.tar from files foo and bar.\n"
"  tar -tvf archive.tar         # List all files in archive.tar verbosely.\n"
"  tar -xf archive.tar          # Extract all files from archive.tar.\n"
msgstr ""
"GNU 'tar' saglabā daudzus failus kopā vienā lentes vai diska arhīvā un var atjaunot atsevišķus failus no arhīva.\n"
"\n"
"Piemēri:\n"
"  tar -cf archive.tar foo bar  # Izveido archive.tar no failiem foo un bar.\n"
"  tar -tvf archive.tar         # Detalizēti uzskaita visus failus archive.tar.\n"
"  tar -xf archive.tar          # Izgūst visus failus no archive.tar.\n"

#: src/tar.c:448
msgid ""
"The backup suffix is '~', unless set with --suffix or SIMPLE_BACKUP_SUFFIX.\n"
"The version control may be set with --backup or VERSION_CONTROL, values are:\n"
"\n"
"  none, off       never make backups\n"
"  t, numbered     make numbered backups\n"
"  nil, existing   numbered if numbered backups exist, simple otherwise\n"
"  never, simple   always make simple backups\n"
msgstr ""
"Dublējuma piedēklis ir '~', ja vien nav iestatīts ar --suffix vai\n"
"SIMPLE_BACKUP_SUFFIX.\n"
"Versiju kontroli var iestatīt ar --backup vai VERSION_CONTROL, vērtības ir:\n"
"\n"
"  none, off       nekad neveidot dublējumus\n"
"  t, numbered     veidot numurētus dublējumus\n"
"  nil, existing   numurētus, ja numurēti dublējumi pastāv, citādi vienkāršus\n"
"  never, simple   vienmēr veidot vienkāršus dublējumus\n"

